"cues": [
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 3.2,
"end": 6.763,
"text": "So far: Emma's text became 100 tokens."
},
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 7.263,
"end": 11.861,
"text": "Each token became a vector of 896 numbers."
},
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 12.511,
"end": 16.597,
"text": "24 blocks updated every vector, in one pass."
},
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 17.097,
"end": 21.451,
"text": "And we keep just one: the last position's final vector."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 22.201,
"end": 25.823,
"text": "Now: how does that vector become the next token?"
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 26.573,
"end": 28.894,
"text": "First, a final RMSNorm."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 29.394,
"end": 39.448,
"text": "It divides all 896 numbers by their root mean square, here 1.89, then multiplies each by a learned gain."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 39.948,
"end": 42.781,
"text": "Same direction, fixed scale."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 43.531,
"end": 45.005,
"text": "Then, scoring."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 45.563,
"end": 54.676,
"text": "The model's table has one row per token: 151,936 rows of 896 numbers."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 55.176,
"end": 62.107,
"text": "Multiply the vector with a row, number by number, and add it up: one dot product, one score."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 62.607,
"end": 65.962,
"text": "For We, it comes to 20.84."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 66.712,
"end": 69.358,
"text": "And this table? We have met it before."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 69.858,
"end": 72.505,
"text": "It is the embedding table from section 3."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 73.063,
"end": 79.622,
"text": "The same table that reads tokens in now scores them on the way out: tied weights."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 80.372,
"end": 85.805,
"text": "That gives one score per row, called a logit. Only five pass 18."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 86.363,
"end": 88.685,
"text": "We: 20.84."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 89.242,
"end": 94.536,
"text": "As: 18.88. Manchester: 18.62."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 95.286,
"end": 97.503,
"text": "Softmax turns them into probabilities."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 98.003,
"end": 102.391,
"text": "Raise e to each logit: for We, 1.13 billion."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 102.891,
"end": 106.663,
"text": "Divide by the sum over every row: 2.0 billion."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 107.163,
"end": 113.861,
"text": "We gets 56 percent. As, 8. Manchester, 6. All together, one."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 114.611,
"end": 119.707,
"text": "Then one token is picked. Greedy takes the top one: We, every time."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 120.207,
"end": 123.84,
"text": "Sampling spins a weighted wheel. Five real spins: As."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 124.34,
"end": 131.376,
"text": "City. We. We. We. In a thousand spins, We wins 582."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 132.126,
"end": 133.994,
"text": "Temperature divides the logits first."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 134.494,
"end": 139.59,
"text": "At 0.7, the gaps grow: We rises to 82 percent."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 140.09,
"end": 147.08,
"text": "At 1.2, they shrink: We falls to 41. And temperature zero is greedy."
},
{
"block": "b10",
"t": 147.83,
"end": 150.663,
"text": "Our run is greedy, so the choice is We."
},
{
"block": "b10",
"t": 151.313,
"end": 155.957,
"text": "It joins the end of the text, and the whole machine runs again."
}
]
